    1. Pick grid dimensions H (4-8) and W (6-12, even).
    2. Compute available gap levels G = {W-1-2k for k=0..W/2-1}, all odd.
    3. Choose 1-3 distinct gap levels from G; designate the smallest as min_gap.
    4. For each of H rows, independently assign either empty or one of the chosen gap levels.
